e stars over the West Side Highway. INKwell Harbor Club Rooftop 621 W 46th 
 
Street (West Side Highway)\, NYC 10036 T (646) 696-8879 Friday\, November 2
 
0 Doors Open Afterwork at 5PM Event Ends at 11pm One night. One rooftop. Al
 
l black. Upscale. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/funkmaster-f
 
